d; d18: d03 base64, d07 caesar, d12 hex, d13 base64, d18 xor; d19: d03\n  base64, d05 split, d11 xor, d18 xor, d19 reflection), all under\"\"\")\nrep(\"accepted the decoded puzzle value as the \\\"backend evidence code\\\" on all 18 days.\",\"accepted the decoded puzzle value as the \\\"backend evidence code\\\" on all 19 days.\")\nrep(\"\"\"- Pattern d16-d18: the SINGLE variant carries only flavour; the TT build carries the real mechanic in code (d16 JNI gate,\n  d17 renamed class `a` + dex hint `R8-style collapse: follow b -> a and ignore field c` + `decoy`/`telemetry` strings,\n  d18 a `decryptByte` method + `STRUCTURAL` string in class `EncryptedStrings`). Every time the asset STILL held the answer.\"\"\",\"\"\"- Pattern d16-d19: the SINGLE variant carries only flavour; the TT build carries the real mechanic in code (d16 JNI gate,\n  d17 renamed class `a` + dex hint `R8-style collapse: follow b -> a and ignore field c` + `decoy`/`telemetry` strings,\n  d18 a `decryptByte` method + `STRUCTURAL` string in class `EncryptedStrings`, d19 only `dispatch` + `STRUCTURAL` strings\n  -- no `forName`/`getMethod`/`invoke` anywhere). Every time the asset STILL held the answer.\"\"\")\n# variant axes\nrep(\"\"\"  d04-set 21, d11-set 232, d17 d04-set 104, d18: 20/99/233 -- full 0-255 range\"\"\",\"\"\"  d04-set 21, d11-set 232, d17 d04-set 104, d18: 20/99/233, d19 Mastery d11-set 109, d18-set 44 -- full 0-255 range\"\"\")\nrep(\"\"\"  read them from `huntress_puzzle.json` every time. Keyless codecs (`reverse`, `base64`, `native`) differ only in `data`.\"\"\",\"\"\"  read them from `huntress_puzzle.json` every time. Keyless codecs (`reverse`, `base64`, `native`, `reflection`) differ\n  only in `data`. Theme-named codecs (`native` d15-d16, `reflection` d19) carried the PLAINTEXT in `data` in every variant.\"\"\")\nrep(\"\"\"  10/15/18, dealt 03/07/12/13/18); the last set was always today's.\"\"\",\"\"\"  10/15/18, dealt 03/07/12/13/18; d19: 03/05/11/18/19, d05 split as a 6-entry